## 2026-10-05 â€” CDP testing pitfalls (FloorPlan3D)
- React 19 commits after `await sleep(60)` â€” click a toolbar button and query the DOM in the same sync block returns stale nodes
- `svg.dispatchEvent(new PointerEvent(...))` makes `e.target` the svg: hit-tests via `e.target.closest(...)` miss â€” dispatch on the specific element (`gap.dispatchEvent`) instead
- Number inputs commit on Enter (`keydown`) or focusout (`focusout`, not `blur`); selects use native `change` after setting `.value`
- Screenshot helper: `...\Temp\opencode\cdp-shot.ps1` (use `New-Object byte[] N`, never `New-Object byte N`)
- **Unsolved anomaly:** under the CDP harness, 2 of ~15 packed multi-step async scripts produced phantom extra actions (an extra room+door once; a phantom door later mutated by unknown terrace/flip patches). Not reproducible when scripts are split or instrumented (addRoom/placeOpening counters stayed 1/1); possibly harness/HMR artifact, worth re-checking if seen in real use

