- New `src/editor/FloorPanel.tsx` (bottom-left `.fp3d-floor-panel`: chips top-first, + Add floor, name/elevation/height + Move up/down/Delete), wired in `App.tsx`, CSS (`.fp3d-floor-panel`, `.fp3d-btn:disabled`)
