- Why: next = furniture/library or storage (IndexedDB + JSON import/export)

## 2026-10-05 â€” More CDP pitfalls (FloorPlan3D)
- `pointermove`/`pointerup` dispatched on `window` never reach React handlers (listeners are rooted below window) â€” dispatch every pointer event on the svg/target element
- `location.reload()` inside the evaluated script is unreliable (context-destruction race) â€” reload in a separate cdp-eval call, sleep 2-3 s, then run the test script
- Reconfirmed anomaly: packed multi-op scripts drifted (floor count/room landed on wrong floor); the clean reload + single-pass script was fully consistent â€” keep scripts single-purpose after a fresh reload

