- `Canvas.tsx`: pointerdown "measure" = `tap` (drag pans); pointerup tap â†’ `measureAdd(snapAt(...))` (same snapping as polygon: grid/vertices/edges/walls, Alt free); `renderMeasure` shows the chain + live segment to the cursor + a label per segment, rendered whenever `measure` is non-empty (persists across tool switches); keyboard Backspace = undo point, Escape = clear (then back to select on a second press)
