## 2026-10-06 â€” Vite dev-server stale transform (FloorPlan3D)
- After editing `App.tsx` (adding an import and a JSX child in separate edits), the running Vite dev server served an `App.tsx` transform whose body was stale: it had the new `import` but not the new `<ProjectPanel/>`, so the panel never rendered while the rest of the app did
- `location.reload()` and HMR did not fix it; `git`/disk were correct; only restarting `vite` cleared it (kill the listener on 5173, start again)
- Also seen: after rapid edits + running `npm run build` at the same time, HMR logged repeated updates and an invalidate. Lesson: restart the dev server before browser verification after a burst of file edits

